niol BP grade, terpinolene, tetrahydroflorol, tetrahydrogeraniol, tetrahydrogeranyl acetate, tetrahydromyrcenol, timber forte, timber touch, eucalyptol, cineole, cyclademol, cyclamen aldehyde, indomeran, floravone, ambery woody extreme, camphor, and iso borneol commercial. The company was formerly known as Fairchem Speciality Limited and changed its name to Privi Speciality Chemicals Limited in October 2020. Privi Speciality Chemicals Limited was incorporated in 1985 and is based in Mumbai, India."}}